  "title": "Easy Peanut Butter Chocolate Chip Cookies",
  "description": "These easy peanut butter chocolate chip cookies made with natural peanut butter are simple to make and ready in just 30 minutes.",
  "authors": [
    "Barb Gurley"
  ],
